      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Thus, the approach to the equilibrium allele frequency in the two sexes is gradual and oscillatory if the locus is X linked (Figure 4.2). The deviation of the allele frequency from $ p_{1} $ is halved each generation for both males and females, but the sign changes from generation to generation.",
